   $q$Which sentence would best fill the blank in sentence 4 by explaining the quotation in sentence 3?$q$, $q$[{"text":"This shows that Mateo is happy for Priya and proud of how well she played.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"This shows that the band director posted the audition results on a list.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"summary-not-analysis"},{"text":"This shows that Mateo needs new glasses because he cannot read small letters well.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"This image shows how shocked and hurt Mateo feels when he loses the position he has worked for.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$This image shows how shocked and hurt Mateo feels when he loses the position he has worked for.$q$, $q$Staring until the letters blur suggests Mateo is stunned and upset, which the next sentence about ignoring Priya confirms. Reading the blur as an eyesight problem takes the image literally and misses the feeling it shows.$q$, 'draft', '4e31bf17-6d41-5668-8cfc-b8508b36c22c')
