   $q$The writer wants to add a quotation from the story after sentence 8. Which quotation would best support the idea that Mateo has started to change?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Priya's family had moved from a city three hours away.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"focus-on-wrong-character"},{"text":"\"Mateo had bought his first trumpet with money from mowing lawns.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-backstory"},{"text":"\"The band room smelled of valve oil and old sheet music.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"\"He told himself the concert mattered more than the chair.\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"He told himself the concert mattered more than the chair."$q$, $q$This quotation shows Mateo putting the group's success ahead of his own position, which is the change the paragraph describes. The quotation about buying his trumpet is about Mateo, but it tells about his past, not his growth.$q$, 'draft', '4e31bf17-6d41-5668-8cfc-b8508b36c22c')
