   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 11?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For instance","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-instead-of-summary"},{"text":"Unlike sketching","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"Before the change","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-relationship"},{"text":"In other words","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In other words$q$, $q$Sentence 11 restates what the interviews mean in a broader way, so "In other words" fits. "For instance" would introduce a new example, but sentence 11 sums up the examples already given.$q$, 'draft', '1e122d82-b647-57bc-8510-ed2ddb338831')
