   $q$Which sentence would best fill the blank in sentence 12 to conclude the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Overall, Haddad shows that the share table keeps good food out of the trash and feeds hungry students, though it needs daily care.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Overall, share tables will end hunger and food waste in every school in the country.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Overall, a share table is a spot where students leave sealed food they do not want to eat.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"definition-not-conclusion"},{"text":"Overall, cafeterias should serve smaller portions so that students throw away less food.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-extension"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Overall, Haddad shows that the share table keeps good food out of the trash and feeds hungry students, though it needs daily care.$q$, $q$The best conclusion restates both parts of the claim and keeps the limit from sentence 11. The choice about ending hunger and waste everywhere claims far more than one school's share table can show.$q$, 'draft', '602f6ab6-9b85-57fe-8cfa-73635c90d39c')
